buildabook NEWS — user-visible changes

0.1.0  (unreleased)
  * Initial release: outline-language book builder extracted from the three
    book projects (recheboc, speedrun, viking-poets) into one Ada program.
  * buildabook html: render with an HTML template (book.html.typ, default in
    template/) and compile with Typst's HTML export to <slug>.html.
  * buildabook readme: with <slug>.html present, add an HTML row and link the
    contents to the chapters in that page.
